<Defs>

  <ThingDef ParentName="AnimalThingBase">
    <defName>RM_Scabspinner</defName>
    <label>scabspinner</label>
    <description>A patchy-furred ambusher whose webs are half silk, half scab — it spins over its own sores and over its burrow mouth alike, and both hold. Crusted spinnerets, mange-map bald patches, joints re-silked daily. It hunts the small cast of the flats and flees anything larger.</description>
